\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Reference membership and independent utility on four real networks ($k=5$, $p=0.01$, $h=3$, step coupling). (a) Thin lines show all ten path trajectories per network; thick lines show mean adjacent-budget Jaccard overlap. (b) Mean full-greedy incremental spread with 95\% percentile bootstrap intervals over ten paths. Evaluation uses 10,000 disjoint worlds per path. Intervals concern computational paths on fixed graphs; they are not population-network intervals. Colours and marker shapes identify networks}}{9}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:reference}{{1}{9}{Reference membership and independent utility on four real networks ($k=5$, $p=0.01$, $h=3$, step coupling). (a) Thin lines show all ten path trajectories per network; thick lines show mean adjacent-budget Jaccard overlap. (b) Mean full-greedy incremental spread with 95\% percentile bootstrap intervals over ten paths. Evaluation uses 10,000 disjoint worlds per path. Intervals concern computational paths on fixed graphs; they are not population-network intervals. Colours and marker shapes identify networks}{figure.1}{}}
