\newlabel{tab:budget-effects}{{4}{10}{Mean candidate-minus-full spread changes with reference resolution. W4 and D4 denote weighted-degree and topology-degree $4k$ pools. Each entry averages ten paired path comparisons; signs of means are descriptive, not separate significance claims}{table.4}{}}
